# Hitting the Marquisate (windurst 71): the offer's quest and mustZone operands. A THF at level 50, Mihgo's Amigo and The
# Tenshodo Showdown completed; As Thick as Thieves accepted (not completed): not available: its 505. Completed by GM,
# the char-var mustZone set by GM: not available: 76 (As Thick as Thieves' local var of that name is not this one); a
# warp out and back: 512, begun.
lists WindurstWoods/Nanaa_Mihgo/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=66.5,-4.75,239.6 job=THF lvl=50
quest Windurst.MihgosAmigo completed
quest Windurst.TheTenshodoShowdown completed
quest Windurst.AsThickAsThieves accepted
login
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # As Thick as Thieves accepted: its 505 (0, note)
finish
quest Windurst.AsThickAsThieves completed      # GM
charvar Quest[2][71]mustZone 241               # GM
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # the mustZone: 76
finish
warp -24.5,-14.498,262.994 WindurstWalls
warp 66.5,-4.75,239.6 WindurstWoods            # the mustZone cleared
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # 512
finish                                         # begun; the note
